  "text": "总是在选择\n\n光明正大地抛弃\n\n名之曰“喜爱”\n\n作为自己的标签\n\n\n\n\n雪一定会融化\n\n在大地上融化\n\n花一定会凋落\n\n在歌曲中凋落\n\n\n\n\n \n\n有那样一间房子\n\n有那样一群孩子\n\n会来代替他\n\n成为你心上的花\n\n\n\n\n不随风去\n\n不随梦醉\n\n\n\n\n在人群之外游荡\n\n在丢失钥匙之后\n\n\n\n\n花就开放在\n\n柳叶、竹叶、莲叶\n\n病床前百叶窗的眉心\n\n他的或我的手心\n\n\n\n\n 请灿烂地开放吧\n\n于此间春末的晚境\n\n\n\n\n2016.7.3",
  "html": "<p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">总是在选择</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">光明正大地抛弃</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">名之曰“喜爱”</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">作为自己的标签</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">雪一定会融化</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">在大地上融化</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">花一定会凋落</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">在歌曲中凋落</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">有那样一间房子</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">有那样一群孩子</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">会来代替他</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">成为你心上的花</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不随风去</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">不随梦醉</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">在人群之外游荡</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">在丢失钥匙之后</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">花就开放在</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">柳叶、竹叶、莲叶</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">病床前百叶窗的眉心</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">他的或我的手心</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\"> 请灿烂地开放吧</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">于此间春末的晚境</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">2016.7.3</span></p>",
